{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe","id":829915,"title":"I draw your characters maybe","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-14T17:03:35-08:00","id":829915,"title":"I draw your characters maybe","content":"Edit: Project is on hold; see my posts on second page.<br /> <br /> I have a shit-ton of new art supplies and I don't know what to draw, and one of my goals for this year is to get back into arting. Tell me about your character and I'll draw them. I reserve the right to produce shit art, work in any medium or style that I fancy, change details of your character at whim, and maybe even ultimately flake out and do nothing. Go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":229,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","user":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","date":". 02-14-2016, 11:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T17:10:58-08:00","id":829919,"title":"","content":"Snow-White Aurora: Equal parts Disney Princess and Enkidu, she the heiress to a fallen throne, who grew up in the Northern wilderness, and uses her music to unite an army of beasts (mostly bears).<br /> <br /> (Physical details omitted, because seeing what look someone imagines from hearing &quot;Disney Enkidu&quot; is half the fun.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T17:11:51-08:00","id":829920,"title":"","content":"And she looks like...?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T17:15:34-08:00","id":829923,"title":"","content":"Bah, a reply before my edit.<br /> <br /> I maintain that seeing the imaginings of others is half the fun, but she's fairly toned, long-haired, and wears half-cured furs (enough of them to actually cover her). Typically very curious, as she tries to decide on whether to attempt to destroy civilization with the beast army.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T17:17:48-08:00","id":829924,"title":"","content":"Master Ink is a Zenith Caste philosopher-general, more or less meant to be a gender-flipped anime Mozi. She has a fairly swarthy complextion, short cut straight dark hair and sharp amber eyes. Her demeanor is typically confident and even smarmy, befitting the gadfly image of a philosopher.<br /> <br /> Hailing from Vaneha, but having spent a decade in the Hundred Kingdoms, she often wears a simple set of foreign lamellar armor (something more Korean than Japanese-styled like you'd think from Samurailand), wearing a white sash stained with ink around her waist to signify the leadership of her army. Her armaments typically include a crossbow and a round shield, along with a commander's fan.<br /> <br /> Her anima typically manifests as a scrolling text various aphorisms and words of wisdom in High Realm in briliant gold-white light.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":353,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","user":"Blaque","date":". 02-14-2016, 08:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T17:26:15-08:00","id":829929,"title":"","content":"Also, Castes please.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T17:33:02-08:00","id":829930,"title":"","content":"Ah, that is a good point. Zenith.<br /> <br /> (And in case it's not abundantly clear, should you be more interested in other concepts and bypass Snow-White Aurora outright, I won't be even slightly miffed or bothered. It's an odd concept, and this is your hobby. One should never spend precious hobby time on something unfun.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T17:39:47-08:00","id":829933,"title":"","content":"Anima and Caste added.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T17:48:49-08:00","id":829935,"title":"","content":"<b>Steelwrought Ocelot<br /> - Antiquarian - Sorcerer - Recluse - Drunkard -<br /> Caste: </b>Twilight (Kinda not yet exalted... so this is what I planned.)<br /> <br /> Ocelot is an Ysyran exile, who have spent the last few years stuck in a minor port-city in Prasad, disguised as a antiquarian and drunk of his ass whenever he can get away with it.<br /> Hiding from his countrymen as well as their poor reputation, Ocelot constantly seems concerned with matters beyond human understanding. And that is mostly true. Unless he's blasted off his ass on a new narcotic acquired to sooth the immense regret that eats away at him.<br /> <br /> He's a haggardly looking fellow, a more Mediterranean version of John Constantine from Hellblazer mixed with Bernard Black.<br /> Dressed in decent robes of Prasadi manufacture, Ocelot never leaves home without an array of amulets and assorted occult knick-knacks.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>__________________________________________________ </b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b><i>Preaching the enlightened gospels of Gaming Anarchy</i></b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/225-growls","name":"Growls","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar225_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T17:59:50-08:00","id":829940,"title":"","content":"(Chejop you have no idea how tempted I am to just draw Korra and then label her with your character's name.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T18:01:53-08:00","id":829942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stephen Lea Sheppard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe?p=829940#post829940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Chejop you have no idea how tempted I am to just draw Korra and then label her with your character's name.)</div> </div> </div> </div>(I like the way you troll, Sephenls.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T18:05:09-08:00","id":829943,"title":"","content":"Delphim, Child of the Storm<br /> Not an Exalt, but a God-Blooded child of the orca-goddess Kireeki, he's tall and strong and approaching middle-age, but the sort of middle-age that you see on the affluent. He's a Cyanin from the Neck and revered as a sorcerer there. He has bronze skin, long blue hair he keeps in a tight braid, and intense golden eyes; he wears blue silks and cloth-of-silver sparkling with sapphires and pearls. A black-and-white amulet of an orca whale with tentacles dangles on a silver chain around his neck.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T18:36:37-08:00","id":829962,"title":"","content":"Okay so this thread hasn't resulted in any art I want to finish so far but it <i>has</i> resulted in a resolution to by a goddamn lightbox the next time I get a paycheck so that's a plus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T18:37:13-08:00","id":829963,"title":"","content":"<b>Hadariel, Undaunted Martyr, Dawn Caste</b><br /> <br /> First born son of two exceptional socialite Dragonbloods of Loosky. He meanwhile inherited almost nothing from them, being dumber than a bag of rocks in both intellectual and social pursuits, having a soft heart, and failing to Exalt as a Dragonblood past his 20th birthday. Despite these failings his family still loved him up to and after he became a dreaded Anathema, his parents and siblings figuring he was too dumb to be corrupted by their demonic powers after he willingly surrendered himself to them after learning what he was.<br /> <br /> His only redeeming features were his skill with the sword, which his Exaltation built upon until he could fight armies singlehandedly, and his ongoing attempts to befriend everything he didn't kill in combat. On the battlefield he is found in heavy articulated plate constructed of black jade with the barest trimming of orichalcum along the edges and a blade he owns no scabbard for. Outside of his life of combat he prefers a simple, if well manicured, appearance of well constructed clothes with his longer hair kept back in a tight top knot.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/837-myckou","name":"Myckou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar837_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T19:59:23-08:00","id":829994,"title":"","content":"<b>Rreveka Thess, Dawn Caste, aka &quot;Dreaming Pearl Motherfucker&quot;</b><br /> <br /> Mysterious ill-tempered unstoppable warrior who wanders the world, frequently drinking really awful tea and often murdering really awful people with teacup handles or half of a chopstick or something. Wishes people would stop being unrighteous in front of him so he could finish drinking himself into the ground, but clearly that's not happening anytime soon. Makes a big deal about being an uncouth hick from nowhere, but if you recite the <i>Classic of Gardening</i> and make enough mistakes he will totally start correcting you and throwing things. He is probably a courtier who snapped one day and decided to give up strumming sanxians and become the world's biggest badass instead.<br /> <br /> An exceedingly unkempt fellow of completely indeterminate but &gt;29 age. First layer is clothes that might have been really nice twenty barfights ago, second layer is scars, third layer is mostly muscle. Fourth &quot;heart of gold&quot; layer still unconfirmed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T20:01:03-08:00","id":829995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stephen Lea Sheppard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe?p=829962#post829962\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay so this thread hasn't resulted in any art I want to finish so far but it <i>has</i> resulted in a resolution to by a goddamn lightbox the next time I get a paycheck so that's a plus.</div> </div> </div> </div>Out of curiousity, what are the particular tools you picked up and what are some of the things you're trying so far?<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T20:19:18-08:00","id":830001,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe?p=829995#post829995\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Out of curiousity, what are the particular tools you picked up and what are some of the things you're trying so far?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's irrelevant until I actually produce.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T20:31:29-08:00","id":830007,"title":"","content":"This has actually been really instructional. I've done about six different sketches of Chejop's character, who in my head looks like a cross between Korra, Samantha Wright, Ashol-Pan (Google her), and a genderflipped Shan Yu from Mulan, and I've <i>hated <b>all</b></i> of them. And because I'm trying to do a piece worthy of finishing, I'm drawing on good paper, which means every time I half-finish a sketch and realize it won't do, I erase it.<br /> <br /> If I had a lightbox I could do the initial sketches on less good paper, finish them, and learn from them as I iterate towards something useful for tracing onto good paper to make into a real piece. So. Project on hold until next week.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T20:33:07-08:00","id":830008,"title":"","content":"<b>Tiger of Lustrous Jade</b> is a Lookshy <u>Air</u> Aspected Terrestial of minor Gens, meaning he has the typical athletic/lean version of a River Province native's build except that is skin is faintly tinged blue. Tiger started out as an educated and affected intellectual (before several rude awakenings) with a wise maxim/old proverb for all occasions, so draw him rolling his black eyes, in humor or disdain, with his chief affectation: a fan open and in use. Actually, only people who had seen Tiger use his pair of Heavenly Thunder Leaves knew why he 'carried a spare', everybody else thought him<u> very</u> affected.<br /> <br /> The Leaves depict the story of the Terrestial <i>Billowing Reed</i> who was abducted and eventually escaped a Lunar. Tiger usually used the Billowing Reed fan, showing a female Exalt against a variety of namesake plants. Tiger only used the other one with the hideous Lunar and ugly beastmen to indicate when he was quite put out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like my Avatar? Courtesy of<span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> Jen</span>! : <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Anybody want their characters to be experimented on ? </span>post 98<br /> <i>An Exalt is never unarmed.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4018-l-het-esh","name":"L'het'esh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T21:47:37-08:00","id":830035,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stephen Lea Sheppard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe?p=830007#post830007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...Chejop's character, who in my head looks like a cross between Korra, Samantha Wright, Ashol-Pan (Google her), and a genderflipped Shan Yu from Mulan...</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow - such a cool list of influences, <i>and</i> I get to learn about a teenaged eagle-wrangling huntress?<br /> <br /> I thought my birthday wasn't for a month and a half - this is <i>gold</i>!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-15T07:26:16-08:00","id":830219,"title":"","content":"Infinitely iterating sketches is one of the reasons I do most of my artwork digitally these days.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-15T08:06:05-08:00","id":830231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe?p=830219#post830219\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Infinitely iterating sketches</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know what this Charm would do but I feel like it should exist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-15T08:51:53-08:00","id":830256,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe?p=830219#post830219\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Infinitely iterating sketches is one of the reasons I do most of my artwork digitally these days.</div> </div> </div> </div>Whenever I do digital art I get more and more frustrated until I delete it. Switching to physical media is an attempt to do an end-run around this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-15T09:57:18-08:00","id":830283,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stephen Lea Sheppard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe?p=830256#post830256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Whenever I do digital art I get more and more frustrated until I delete it. Switching to physical media is an attempt to do an end-run around this.</div> </div> </div> </div>Kind of a good example of different workflows in that.<br /> <br /> Of late, when I thumbnail I do that as sketches in my sketchbook in pen. It forces you to conserve lines and to really think on what you want to do, as well as to not get too attached to soemthing and focus on gesture, composition and such. Then I try to go to the sketch-ink-color thing in the computer from that.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-15T10:03:33-08:00","id":830286,"title":"","content":"In general, practice is better to do in physical media, since that'll translate into digital much better than the reverse. <br /> <br /> Of course, I also recommend practice with pen/inks only, so you can't erase, which a lot of people don't agree with ^_^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/855-magistrate","name":"Magistrate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-16T10:14:51-08:00","id":831120,"title":"","content":"<i>Infinitely iterating sketches</i><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blackwell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe?p=830231#post830231\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know what this Charm would do but I feel like it should exist.</div> </div> </div> </div>Realm's power from FFVI!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-16T10:16:14-08:00","id":831123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tikor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe?p=831120#post831120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Infinitely iterating sketches</i><br /> <br /> Realm's power from FFVI!</div> </div> </div> </div>So I'm NOT the only person who thought this exact thing!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-23T00:49:18-07:00","id":851618,"title":"","content":"Are you still doing this, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar229_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"229\" data-vbnamecard=\"229\">Stephen Lea Sheppard</a>?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-23T02:47:00-07:00","id":851638,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sanctaphrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe?p=851618#post851618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are you still doing this, <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>?</div> </div> </div> </div>Check the first sentence of the original post - it's on hold.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-23T13:02:25-07:00","id":851947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe?p=851638#post851638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Check the first sentence of the original post - it's on hold.</div> </div> </div> </div>Project is on hold indefinitely while I teach myself how to draw again from scratch. If you're interested in how that's going, check out stephenleasheppard.tumblr.com where I post horrible sketch pages every day, except for this week where I'm trying to outrun Daredevil spoilers instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-23T14:41:04-07:00","id":852027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stephen Lea Sheppard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe?p=851947#post851947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm trying to outrun Daredevil spoilers</div> </div> </div> </div>Hope this doesn't ruin anything for you, but that Matt Murdock guy? Turns out he was blind <i>the whole time</i>.<br /> <br /> (<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-23T20:02:49-07:00","id":852204,"title":"","content":"Hell's Kitchen is not actually a kitchen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/K9a6Pmp.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/998-korhal_iv","name":"Korhal_IV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"592"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-24T07:40:12-07:00","id":852424,"title":"","content":"Daredevil isn't even a devil!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-24T12:06:03-07:00","id":852530,"title":"","content":"Well, I finished Daredevil, so back to spending all my free time practicing art again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-24T15:51:42-07:00","id":852638,"title":"","content":"<b>&quot;Doctor&quot; Erasmus Birthday</b><b>, Back-Alley Sawbones, Twilight Caste</b><br /> <br /> What was Heaven thinking when it conferred Exaltation upon Erasmus Birthday? Was it impressed by his sallow skin, ill-fitting robes, and sketchy dangling mustache? Intrigued by his innovation and bravery in attempting open-heart surgery on a concussed toddler using only a bottle of vodka, a tuna skeleton, and a folding chair? Inspired by his commitment to perfecting his theory of medicine, no matter how many test subjects I mean patients he had to go through on the way? Or did it just fear for the life of the kid he was about to pry open if he were to do so without the aid of phenomenal cosmic power? Whatever the case, Doctor Birthday now gains fame as a true hero of the slums. When no one else can save your sickly relative, rabid hamster, or alcohol-poisoned roommate, Doctor Birthday is there to help, with such revolutionary and incredible approaches as &quot;drink this potion, I don't know for sure what it does but it's a promising color,&quot; &quot;if we give you a couple extra feet then we won't have to worry about fixing the existing one,&quot; or &quot;just trust me, pal, I'm a doctor.&quot; His treatments shouldn't work\u2014couldn't work, couldn't possibly\u2014but a Solar Exalt is truly capable of anything.<br /> <br /> Image reference:<br /> <img src=\"http://tmlewin-blog.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/11/fu-manchu.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new\"><a href=\"https://jamesmendezhodes.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Mendez</span></a></span></div> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\"><b>Currently Developing</b> you know I should probably stop updating this field, I keep accidentally announcing things early<br /> <b>Crowdfund Me </b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mndz\" target=\"_blank\">via Patreon</a>: essays about race, religion, and culture in gaming</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8310-lula","name":"Lula","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8310_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-24T18:57:38-07:00","id":852740,"title":"","content":"Oh, hey, I just noticed this thread. You already seem pretty good to me and it seems like you're picking really good studies to work on! As someone who has no facility at all with a pen, I like that stippling a lot.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stephen Lea Sheppard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe?p=830256#post830256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Whenever I do digital art I get more and more frustrated until I delete it. Switching to physical media is an attempt to do an end-run around this.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've been doing something a bit similar to this recently and while I'm not nearly good enough to have real advice, I do recommend you not wait until you're happy with your style before trying to work digitally, because there really are a whole lot of new things to learn and it'll be <i>really</i> frustrating to try to learn them when you already have your physical-media style just the way you like it. But...yeeeah I can relate a lot.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stephen Lea Sheppard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/829915-i-draw-your-characters-maybe?p=830007#post830007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This has actually been really instructional. I've done about six different sketches of Chejop's character, who in my head looks like a cross between Korra, Samantha Wright, Ashol-Pan (Google her), and a genderflipped Shan Yu from Mulan, and I've <i>hated <b>all</b></i> of them. And because I'm trying to do a piece worthy of finishing, I'm drawing on good paper, which means every time I half-finish a sketch and realize it won't do, I erase it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can't not picture Kejak as late-life George Carlin, Master of Seven Dirty Words Style.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/104-gayo","name":"Gayo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar104_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1948"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-24T20:17:51-07:00","id":852773,"title":"","content":"So are the pictures Pm'd to us or are they posted somewhere else?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-24T20:58:35-07:00","id":852786,"title":"","content":"If I ever actually do any, I'll post them here, but for now the project is on indefinite hold while I re-learn to draw. I swear I used to be better at this, but likely I just used to be less self-critical.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-24T22:57:47-07:00","id":852823,"title":"","content":"Allow me to add one more potential sketch to the pyre either way.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Baron&quot; Munchausen is a Noble Raksha Eshu older than creation that is all about creating tall tales (some of which are true) and trying to become an exalt himself. The Baron currently can't decide if he should look more like a solar or dragon-blooded and so he has chosen both. The Baron looks in his 30's stands 6'5 tall with perfectly tanned skin bearing heavy fire aspect markings with long sleek red hair and a chiseled jaw. He wears Robed Plate mail with a sunburst emblem that has flaming tendrils that etch themselves across the entirety of his suit. He changes melee weapons regularly so feel free to choose whatever, if any. No matter what angle you look at The Baron he looks like he's posing regally for a painting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T07:56:06-07:00","id":1241830,"title":"","content":"To add my own in hopes of a picture. <br /> Ophris Jushiro is an assassin and spy, serving the interests of his family in far off locales ripe for conquering in the area surrounding Prasad. He has pale aqua, bordering on white hair and skin like snow. He wears silken armor of deep black with trimming of silver and the design of a seven headed serpent on the back and chest, that looks something between a kimono (complete with hakama) and a martial arts gi. He received his training from the serpentine shadow god, Seven Coiling Shadows, who taught him the snake and ebon shadow styles in addition to the assassin arts.<br /> Seven Shadows looks like seven different huge snakes (ones a viper, another a cobra, etc) made of smoke-like shadows that seem almost like they are made of coiling tendrils. Each speaks in a different voice but all are the same god. <br /> (he also has a belt of shadow walking that looks more like a kimono sash, if that's important at all)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23779-genericmalenpc01","name":"GenericMaleNPC01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23779_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T08:55:00-07:00","id":1241854,"title":"","content":"That's some Labyrinth necromancy there, bro.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T09:42:47-07:00","id":1241886,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I'm afraid he stopped doing it 2 years ago.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T10:20:43-07:00","id":1241899,"title":"","content":"Well if he looks a bit deeper and find the one I made I might actually oblige him due to respect for sheer tenacity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amateur drawsmith","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2847-thatsmellygoblin","name":"ThatSmellyGoblin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2847_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T10:31:54-07:00","id":1241910,"title":"","content":"Yeah, this went nowhere. Instead of putting time into improving my drawing, I got into painting miniatures.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T10:36:57-07:00","id":12419